Apple has raised the prices of the Apple One Family and Apple One Premier plans in select countries in Europe, with the company notifying affected subscribers via email starting today. The updated prices take effect immediately for new subscribers, while existing subscribers will see the increase applied <a href="https://x.com/mistercarter89/status/2107085098852274588">on their next renewal date</a>.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/09/Apple-One-on-Gradient.jpg" alt="" width="2500" height="1406" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1065842" /><br/>
Apple One Family has gone up in price in the following countries:<ul><br/>
  <li>Belgium</li><br/>
  <li>Bulgaria</li><br/>
  <li>Czechia</li><br/>
  <li>Denmark</li><br/>
  <li>Hungary</li><br/>
  <li>Latvia</li><br/>
  <li>Malta</li><br/>
  <li>Portugal</li><br/>
  <li>Slovakia</li><br/>
  <li>Slovenia</li><br/>
  <li>Spain</li><br/>
  <li>Switzerland</li><br/>
</ul>Apple One Premier went up in price in three countries only:<ul><br/>
  <li>Portugal</li><br/>
  <li>Spain</li><br/>
  <li>Switzerland</li><br/>
</ul>In Spain and Portugal, for example, both the Family and Premier plans went up by €2 per month. Increases in other countries and currencies are similar.<br/>
<br/>
Pricing for the Apple One Individual plan has not changed at this time.<br/>
<br/>
Here's what each plan includes:<ul><br/>
  <li><strong>Individual:</strong> 50GB of iCloud+ storage, Apple TV, Apple Music, and Apple Arcade</li><br/>
  <li><strong>Family:</strong> 200GB of iCloud+ storage, Apple TV, Apple Music, and Apple Arcade</li><br/>
  <li><strong>Premier:</strong> 2TB of iCloud+ storage, Apple TV, Apple Music, Apple Arcade, Apple Fitness+, and Apple News+</li><br/>
</ul>This is at least the third round of Apple One price increases this year, which will benefit Apple's services revenue. Apple One Family and Apple One Premier already went up in price in the U.S., Australia, Canada, the U.K., and select other countries earlier this year, while Apple One Individual went up in U.S., Brazil, Chile, and Mexico.<div class="linkback">Tag: <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/apple-one/">Apple One</a></div><br/>This article, &quot;<a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/10/05/apple-one-price-increases-in-select-countries/">Apple One Just Went Up in Price in These Countries</a>&quot; first appeared on <a href="https://www.macrumors.com">MacRumors.com</a><br/><br/><a href="https://forums.macrumors.com/threads/apple-one-just-went-up-in-price-in-these-countries.2491129/">Discuss this article</a> in our forums<br/><br/>